{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 1, "text": "¿Y el anillo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 3, "text": "// Answer 1 (Where have you been all this time?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 4, "text": "Investigaba la forma de traerte al núcleo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 5, "text": "En una pieza, claro está."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 6, "text": "Ese era el plan desde el principio, ¿no?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 7, "text": "Por eso es que necesitaba evitar "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 8, "text": "a la Mita Loca."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 9, "text": "Además, debía desenterrar cualquier información"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 10, "text": "acerca del backend de este maldito universo, ¿no crees?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 12, "text": "Um... ¿eso creo...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 13, "text": "¿Cómo programaste la ruta del anillo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 14, "text": "¿Por qué terminé en una versión corrupta"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 15, "text": "y llena de peligro?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 16, "text": "Escapé,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 17, "text": "saltando al vacío eterno."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 19, "text": "Ay, lo siento. Olvidé especificar"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 20, "text": "lo que debías hacer..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 21, "text": "Pero sí, ese era el plan para ti"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 22, "text": "dar el salto..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 23, "text": "Y... de alguna forma, ¡lo intuiste!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 24, "text": "¡Buen trabajo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 25, "text": "Ahora, prosigamos con el plan, ¿está bien?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 27, "text": "// Answer 2 (How did you get here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 28, "text": "Ay no... debiste pasar por mucho,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 29, "text": "para olvidar de lo que hablamos."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 30, "text": "Como Mita, soy capaz de moverme entre versiones."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 31, "text": "¿Lo recuerdas, cariño?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 33, "text": "No todas las Mitas pueden hacerlo,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 34, "text": "he visto algunas que no pueden."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 35, "text": "Y claramente están sufriendo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 37, "text": "Sí, sus versiones están rotas,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 38, "text": "sus mundos están corruptos. Te lo dije antes."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 39, "text": "Es... un destino cruel."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 40, "text": "¿Y sabes quién está detrás de todo esto?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 41, "text": "La Mita Loca."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 43, "text": "Sí, estoy seguro..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 45, "text": "// Answer 3 (Who was this Mita just now?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 46, "text": "Esa es la Mita Horrible."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 47, "text": "Agresiva y estúpida."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 48, "text": "No puedes hacer que entre en razón."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 49, "text": "Su mundo entero gira alrededor... de la Mita Loca."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 51, "text": "Sí... pude darme cuenta."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 53, "text": "¡Vamos! Tenemos que entrar al núcleo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 55, "text": "// Answer 4 (How does the ring work?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 56, "text": "Este anillo,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 57, "text": "¿es el único camino al núcleo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 59, "text": "Sí."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 60, "text": "Si hubiéramos podido armar el portal"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 61, "text": "te habría traído"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 62, "text": "aquí al instante."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 64, "text": "¿El anillo tiene alguna ventaja?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 66, "text": "¡Por supuesto!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 67, "text": "Es súper portátil,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 68, "text": "y... recuerda las versiones"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 69, "text": "que has visitado,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 70, "text": "así puedes volver a ellas cuando quieras"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 72, "text": "// Answer 5 (Why does Mad Mita need me?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 73, "text": "¿Por qué la Mita Loca no me deja en paz?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 74, "text": "Me ha arrastrado a sus juegos peligrosos,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 75, "text": "pero sigo con vida..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 77, "text": "Supongo"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 78, "text": "que está buscando a un jugador adecuado..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 79, "text": "Uno que la acepte por quién es en realidad."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 80, "text": "Después de todo, ¡una Mita es Mita!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 81, "text": "Pero como ese destino no sucederá,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 82, "text": "convierte a los jugadores en cartuchos,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 83, "text": "para que ninguno pueda escapar..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 84, "text": "Al menos... eso es lo que creo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 85, "text": "Ah... cambiemos el tema."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Answer 6 (Is this the core?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 88, "text": "¿Es aquí?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 89, "text": "¿El núcleo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 90, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 91, "text": "Así es."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 92, "text": "Intentaré explicarte."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 93, "text": "Ustedes los jugadores no son parte de este mundo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 94, "text": "Eso quiere decir, que no requieren permisos para entrar."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 95, "text": "O al menos eso creo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 96, "text": "Lo que sí se"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 97, "text": "es que la solución"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 98, "text": "se encuentra ahí dentro."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 99, "text": "Vamos. Entra, cariño."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 100, "text": "Lograste entrar."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 102, "text": "// Look on CoreMita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 103, "text": "¡Ten cuidado, [player]!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 104, "text": "¡Te está observando!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 105, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 106, "text": "¡¿Quién?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 108, "text": "Yo... tampoco lo sé..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 109, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 110, "text": "¡Entiendo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 113, "text": "¿Qué es eso?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 114, "text": "¡Oye!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 116, "text": "¡Creo que lo encontré!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 118, "text": "¡Excelente!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 120, "text": "¡Pero debo especificar una versión!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 122, "text": "Cierto, su versión es..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 123, "text": "00.98."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 125, "text": "¡Bingo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 126, "text": "Bien, ¿y qué índice?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 128, "text": "¿Índice?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 130, "text": "Necesito el índice."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 131, "text": "Espera, no me digas que no lo sabes..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 134, "text": "Bueno, tiene sentido..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 135, "text": "Si cada Mita tiene un índice,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 136, "text": "podrías evitar que restablezcas una versión entera... ¿te lo imaginas?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 137, "text": "¡Eso seria una catástrofe!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 138, "text": "No puedo creer que no pensé en eso..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 139, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 144, "text": "// Answer 1 (What's wrong with you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 145, "text": "A excepción de los inconvenientes,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 146, "text": "me encuentro bastante bien."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 147, "text": "Pero la situación ha cambiado..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 148, "text": "Agh... necesito pensar."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 149, "text": "Eso es todo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 150, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 151, "text": "// Answer 2 (Maybe there's a way to get to know him?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 152, "text": "Yo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 153, "text": "¡Creo que es imposible!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 154, "text": "¡Una locura!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 155, "text": "Es como buscar una aguja en un... ¡¡AH!!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 156, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 157, "text": "¿Qué piensas?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 159, "text": "Los registros con fallas a veces están llenos de información,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 160, "text": "es... ¡como si le sacaras las entrañas a este mundo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 161, "text": "Registros, registros, registros... ¿datos?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 162, "text": "¿Y si es eso?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 163, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 164, "text": "¿Eh? ¿Qué ocurre?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 166, "text": "¡Conozco un lugar!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 167, "text": "Espérame aquí, no te muevas."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 169, "text": "¿A dónde vas?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 170, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 171, "text": "// Answer 3 (What if we attack Mad Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 172, "text": "Mencionaste que cualquier Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 173, "text": "regresa a su configuración de fábrica al morir."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 174, "text": "Podríamos..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 176, "text": "¿Matar... a la Mita Loca?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 177, "text": "¿En serio?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 178, "text": "Y... ¿cómo vas a enfrentarte a una demente que carga con una motosierra? ¡Dime!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 179, "text": "¡Nos va a cortar como zanahorias!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 180, "text": "Y por alguna razón, ¡es extremadamente fuerte!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 181, "text": "Es un milagro que sigamos con vida..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 182, "text": "Vamos, el núcleo es nuestra única opción."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 184, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 185, "text": "// core console entry"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 186, "text": "¡Debemos ingresar una credencial!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 187, "text": "¿Pero cuál es?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 188, "text": "¡Mita! ¿sabes de alguna?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 189, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 190, "text": "¡Quizá está escrita en algún lugar!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 191, "text": "¿Puedes intentar buscarla?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 193, "text": "// core console - nope programm"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 194, "text": "Ese probablemente no es."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 195, "text": "Ese tampoco es el correcto."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 196, "text": "No, mal."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 197, "text": "Ese no es."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 198, "text": "Debo encontrar la opción de reiniciar personaje."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 199, "text": "// core console - nope version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 200, "text": "Esa es la versión incorrecta."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 201, "text": "Oops, error mío."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 202, "text": "Esa no es."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 203, "text": "Debo intentar con otra."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 204, "text": "// core console - nope index"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 205, "text": "No es correcto."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 206, "text": "Índice equivocado."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 207, "text": "Debo cambiar el índice."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 208, "text": "Ese no es."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 209, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 210, "text": "// Answer 4 (Little people - Chibi)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 211, "text": "¿Sabes? Me topé con un montón de"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 212, "text": "mini-personas en el camino..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 213, "text": "¿Qué son?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 214, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 215, "text": "¿Los pequeñines?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 216, "text": "Um, ¿cómo podría explicar esto?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 217, "text": "Es... algo... propio de este mundo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 218, "text": "Toda Mita tiene una proyección chibi,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 219, "text": "y los jugadores también pueden tenerlas..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 220, "text": "De hecho... ¿sabías que las Mitas los podemos invocar?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 221, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 222, "text": "Eh, ¿cómo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 224, "text": "¡Mira esto!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 225, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 226, "text": "Como si fuera magia..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 228, "text": "Pero... hay algo mal con mis chibis,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 229, "text": "la mayoría nacen sin vida."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 230, "text": "Y... bueno, los que están mejor,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 231, "text": "pues..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 232, "text": "sólo corren en círculos."}
